<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong weather - cloudy and max 30 C.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong weather - cloudy and max 30 C.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong will be cloudy with isolated showers in the morning but with sunny periods during the day. The maximum temperature will reach 30 C, the Royal Observatory said.</p>
<p>At 7 a.m. the temperature was 27 C and the relative humidity 87 percent.</p>
<p>There will be sunny periods apart from a few showers in Hong Kong on Tuesday, the Royal Observatory said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
